  work_order: wo-e50c8f7e3b5d
  source_lineage: ai-assisted-classification.md
  notes: >-
    Obsidian plugin for one-click and batch tagging across many LLM
    providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, Groq, Mistral, local Ollama).
    Returns up to five tags you've used before and at most three genuinely
    new ones per note, so existing vocabulary is reused first and novelty is
    rationed — the article holds this up as a model for a deliberate
    "new tag" escape hatch reviewed in weekly batches.
